alter_toplevel: an alter of a top-level parameter between two operating points (VACASK: alter instance("__topinst__") a=2.0 re-elaborates, r1 = 2k at op2); the smallest form of the corpus's test/test_cblock.sim
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
parameters a=1.0
v1 (in 0) vsource dc=10.0
r1 (in 0) resistor r=1k*a
control
  analysis op1 op
  alter instance("__topinst__") a=2.0
  analysis op2 op
endc
